                                                "sense_id": "2a61035a-d29b-3bb4-864d-a8ee3a9db426",
                                                "text": "Since the Middle Ages, France had developed into a ‘society of orders’, that is, an environment in which a complex set of institutions and corporative bodies enjoyed distinct legal status."
